        "renderPrompt": "An original stylized handcrafted KFB claymation game island, ONE continuous organic geological sandstone clod, broad irregular flat-cap mesa on the left, one needle butte and one two-tier mesa grounded in the same eroded land mass. A source-accurate KFB Joyride v17-style slate-blue race-track ribbon with oxide-red support and red/cream safety curbs enters from a clear legitimate receiver at foreground, takes a readable S-shaped elevated hairpin around the left mesa, passes a justified scenic overlook with safe road-edge barriers, then visibly continues to a destination/exit. Balanced asymmetric contours and vast open sky in painterly 1930s Herriman Coconino spirit, original claymation interpretation not copied panel. Sparse, source-verified cactus and few small rocks. Golden-hour peach sky, ochre cream strata and warm side sunlight. Wide clean single 3/4 hero, no labels, no infographic, no poster border, no floating disconnected islands, no generic bridge pillars, no extra cars/characters/branding; convincing bank and road/terrain continuity. Preserve actual source donor silhouettes only when source pixels are provided; otherwise label MOOD_ONLY. "
